          "id": "ac82efccc47cb4abdbba6d03",
          "locator": "main/block[9]",
          "population_status": "adult_dev_candidate",
          "section": "What causes tinnitus?",
          "start": 0,
          "text": "Hearing loss. Hearing loss, which can be caused by factors such as aging or exposure to loud noise, is strongly associated with tinnitus. Some people with hearing loss, however, never develop tinnitus.",
          "chunk_id": "ac82efccc47cb4abdbba6d03",
